# Battle speed plank (battle-speed): first temple battle with Jian, Lucia, and Gabryel. The plank under the
# status bar reads FAST at the first command input, FASTER and NORMAL after R, and stays through the round;
# it is gone on the victory and result pages. A every 20 frames after that, a shot every 100.
include party3_strong
wait 330
shot sl_fast
press R 5
wait 20
shot sl_faster
press R 5
wait 20
shot sl_normal
press R 5
wait 20
press A 3
wait 17
